  <result aggregation-status="0" type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 2.3. Increased capacity of Member States to engage in a forward-looking international labour standards policy</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Following the launch of the DWCP for Ethiopia (2021-2025), reporting on the application of ratified Conventions improved such that 10 out of 15 requested reports were received in 2022 and 8 out of 9 in 2023 by the CEACR. In the framework of the Decent Work Country Programme (DWCP) for Ethiopia launched in June 2021 (output 4.1.3) the ILO provided assistance to the national constituents to ensure that reports on the application of ratified Conventions were submitted in a timely manner, including replies to comments of the supervisory bodies.</narrative>
   </description>
   <document-link format="TEXT/HTML" url="https://www.ilo.org/IRDashboard/">
    <title>
