    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ILO&#x2019;s Decent Work Results Dashboard &#x2013;complementing the ILO&#x2019;s Programme Implementation Report &#x2013; presents information on the results achieved and on the most significant outputs delivered by the ILO during the relevant biennium.</narrative>
    </description>
